<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About</title>
    <%- include('./partial/head') %>
        <style>
            html {
                font-family: sans-serif;
            }

            .page {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .head {
                background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 32, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 70, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 120, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 70, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 32, 0.9));
                height: 30vh;
                width: 100%;
            }

            .head h1 {
                font-size: 10vh;
                color: white;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 8vh;
            }

            .start {
                max-width: 60vw;
                margin-top: 5vh;
            }

            .start h3 {
                font-family: sans-serif;
                font-size: 15px;
                text-align: left;
            }

            h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }
    
            
            .button label {
                position: absolute;
                z-index: 1;
                margin-top: 6px;
                left: 36vw;
                color: black;
                pointer-events: none;
                transition: 0.3s all ease;
            }

            .button input:focus~label,
            .button input:invalid~label {
                transform: translateY(-10px);
                font-size: 10px;
            }
            
            .button input {
                border-radius: 5px ;
                width: 20vw;
                height: 8vh;
                border: 2px solid black;
            }
            .button button{
                border-radius: 5px ;
                background:linear-gradient(to left,rgb(0, 255, 0),rgb(89, 247, 89),rgb(120, 233, 120));
                height: 8vh;
            }
        </style>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('./partial/nav') %>
        <div class="page">
            <div class="head">
                <h1>
                    About
                </h1>
            </div>
            <div class="start">
                <h3>Want to turn your blog into a business that thrives? You’re in the right place.</h3>

                <h3> Blogging has always required a diverse set of skills.</h3>

                <h3>But in today’s competitive landscape we have to adapt to the reality that blogging is about more
                    than just writing & publishing blog posts.</h3>

                <h3>One minute you’re a social media manager, the next you’re building an ecommerce store so your
                    readers can buy merch. Then, you’re building a sales funnel that allows you to sell products while
                    you sleep.</h3>

                <h3>Then there’s filming and editing videos, etc.</h3>

                <h3>That’s a lot. </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="start">
                <h2>
                    A 360 degree approach to blogging
                </h2>
                <h3>
                    Here’s the good news:
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    On our award winning blog, you’ll find everything you need to know to develop this diverse skill
                    set.
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    We cover content marketing, social media, SEO, ecommerce, marketing & sales, conversion rate
                    optimization, WordPress, website building, and more.
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    You’ll also find plenty of insights to help you monetize your content.
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    We’ll help you leverage every advantage available to save time and automate your blogging business.
                    Not in a lazy way. But in a smart way that keeps the human element (YOU) at the core of your
                    blogging strategy.
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    All of our content is actionable, meticulously crafted by industry experts and read by millions of
                    bloggers & content creators each year.
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    Whether you want to start a blog, launch a YouTube channel, or publish a course – you’ll find the
                    resources to help you.
                </h3>
                <h3>
                    Want to get started? Head over to our blog and start reading.
                </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="start">
                <h2>The beliefs Blogging Wizard is founded upon</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        We don’t have to be great writers or super smart to become successful content creators or start
                        a business. But if we adopt a learning mindset and put in plenty of time and hard work – we can
                        accomplish anything.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        We don’t have to be chained to our business 24/7 to make them successful (but be prepared to
                        work a lot to get it off the ground) – by working smarter, we can ensure we spend more time with
                        those we love.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Countless institutions focus on driving people apart but blogging can bring us together.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        As content creators, we can become genuine change agents and make a difference one person at a
                        time – right from our armchair. Like Gandhi says, “Be the change you wish to see in the world.”
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <h3>
                    We’ve been featured or mentioned by:
                </h3>
                <img src="/images/about.png" alt="" style="width: 56vw;">
                <h3 class="mt-3">Sign up for our newsletter to get our latest posts and 15+ exclusive guides/checklists
                    that you won’t find on the blog.</h3>
            </div>
            <div
                style="margin-top:10vh ; height: 60vh; width: 100%; background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 32, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 70, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 120, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 70, 0.9), rgb(0, 0, 32, 0.9)); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-direction: column;">
                <h3>
                    Unlock The Bloging Wizard Vault
                </h3>
                <div class="start">

                    <h3>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Nostrum, dignissimos!</h3>
                    <h3 style="text-align: center;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="button">
                    <input type="email">
                    <label for="email">Email</label>
                    <button>Get Started</button>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>


        <%- include('./partial/script') %>
</body>

</html>